l,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1405089958","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1787#issuecomment-1405089958","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1787","id":1405089958,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE85Tv_im","user":{"login":"swinslow","id":678569,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3ODU2OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/678569?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow","html_url":"https://github.com/swinslow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2023-01-26T14:32:13Z","updated_at":"2023-01-26T14:32:13Z","body":"I'm +1 to add as a simple, permissive historical license used in Fedora.\r\n\r\nI'd propose the ID `AdaCore-DOC` (capitalizing the \"c\" in \"Core\" to match AdaCore's styling, and \"DOC\" to mirror e.g. [the ID for `FreeBSD-DOC`](https://spdx.org/licenses/FreeBSD-DOC.html)).\r\n\r\nAlthough I am +1 to add this one as-is, I do note from @Rombobeorn's note above that several further variations / extensions of this license are included in the [Ada Reference Manual](https://www.adaic.org/resources/add_content/standards/05rm/html/RM-TTL.html), dating back to 1992. I think we should treat those as separate from the AdaCore-specific request here, but just noting them in case any of those variations later come up for different license ID requests.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1405089958/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1406674892","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1787#issuecomment-1406674892","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1787","id":1406674892,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE85T2CfM","user":{"login":"Rombobeorn","id":7755151,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc3NTUxNTE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7755151?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rombobeorn","html_url":"https://github.com/Rombobeorn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rombobeorn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rombobeorn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rombobeorn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rombobeorn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rombobeorn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rombobeorn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rombobeorn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rombobeorn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rombobeorn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2023-01-27T15:42:18Z","updated_at":"2023-01-27T15:42:18Z","body":"Writing \"DOC\" in capitals seems weird to me when it's not an initialism and there's no reason to pronounce it \"dee-oh-see\", but whatever. If I just get an identifier to put in the Fedora packages, I won't argue about capitalization.","author_association":"NONE","pi